          "id": "s0031",
          "zh": "詹事裴權諫曰：「賈謐甚有寵于中宮，而有不順之色，若一旦交構，大事去矣。",
          "en": "Household Superintendent Pei Quan remonstrated: \"Jia Mi is deeply favored in the inner palace yet shows disrespectful looks—if they ever turn on you, the great enterprise is lost.",
          "literal": "Household Superintendent Pei Quan remonstrated: 'Jia Mi is deeply favored in the inner palace yet shows disrespectful looks—if they ever turn on you, the great enterprise is lost.",
          "blockIndex": 4
        },
        {
          "id": "s0032",
          "zh": "宜深自謙屈，以防其變，廣延賢士，用自輔翼。」",
          "en": "You should humble yourself deeply to guard against change and broadly recruit worthy men to aid your wings.\"",
          "literal": "You should humble yourself deeply to guard against change and broadly recruit worthy men to aid your wings.'",
          "blockIndex": 4
        }
